  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 2025夏日狂欢：志愿者在马赛雷的真实记录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a494fa293471fed472c274</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a494fa293471fed472c274</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Aug 2025 16:03:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我将带大家走进肯尼亚内罗毕的马赛雷贫民窟的夏日狂欢节。志愿者们从7月11日到8月2日在贫民窟筹办了达人秀、艺术展、足球比赛以及希望校园的项目。我很开心在这里用声音捕捉他们的故事与真实感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>/时间轴/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 马赛雷贫民窟简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 达人秀志愿者: Li Congyu</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 艺术组志愿者: Fei Jiajie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 艺术组志愿者: Liu Ruihan</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a> 足球组志愿者: Sun Jiaqi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4609">1:16:49</a> 足球组志愿者: Dai Xiaoyi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5744">1:35:44</a> 希望校园志愿者: Yao Xu ( 公众号: 漫写当下 )</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlBUCeKXPN6p4hNx0xJHY2EsAJp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>全体志愿者合影</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fry0u15rt_ig_mwS07OHeGSp5tqw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>播客录制中</span></p><span></span><p><span>/收听方式/</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用苹果播客、小宇宙app等平台订阅收听《末一 I Moin》</span></p><span></span><p><span>/Logo/剪辑/出品/制作/</span></p><span></span><p><span>Liwen (MoinMoinStudio /末一末一工作室)</span></p><span></span><p><span>/联系方式/</span></p><span></span><p><span>moinmoin.podcasts@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
