  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 从建筑师到BIM领域，总共分几步呢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66253b62c3e09d8f37855a43</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66253b62c3e09d8f37855a43</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 16:14:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/聊天的人/</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Weiwei</span></strong><span> I 小红书账号@weiweiland: base在德国，目前就职于荷兰软件公司BIMcollab，从建筑师转行成BIM consultant</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Liwen </span></strong><span>I YouTube Channel@liliinhamburg: base在汉堡的建筑师</span></p><span></span><p><span>/时间轴/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> Weiwei自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 什么是BIM呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 作为建筑公司的BIM coordinator和软件公司的BIMconsultant 日常具体做什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> BIMcollab软件的功能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> BIM在德国建筑行业使用的现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 从建筑师转入BIM领域的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> BIM培训课程介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 在德国BIM方向就业前景和薪资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> BIM展览的参展经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 国内BIM的发展状况，有BIM的岗位吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 想转入BIM的同学，有什么建议呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>德语名词解释：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Phase: 阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span>General Planner: 总设计</span></p><span></span><p><span>BIM Coordinator: BIM协调员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bauzeichner: 绘图员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Projektbeteiligte: 参与人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ebene: 图层</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tragwerksplanung: 结构设计</span></p><span></span><p><span>Coordinate Punkt: 模型图纸中的参考点</span></p><span></span><p><span>TGA: 建筑设备</span></p><span></span><p><span>Klassification: 分类</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vorlage: 模板</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bauleiter: 项目主管</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljRsIqmJlboUcDgqspjqFqGyTuXy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>/收听方式/</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用苹果播客、小宇宙app等平台订阅收听《末一 I Moin》</span></p><span></span><p><span>/Logo/剪辑/出品/制作/</span></p><span></span><p><span>Liwen(MoinMoinStudio /末一末一工作室)</span></p><span></span><p><span>/音乐/</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Cranberries</span></p><span></span><p><span>Animal Instinct</span></p><span></span><p><span>/联系方式/</span></p><span></span><p><span>moinmoin.podcasts@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
